OL,3,GNEWSANursery fined after baby boy
OL,4,Aburned by bleach
OL,5,
OL,6,FSheriff Harry Small said the incident
OL,7,Fhad been "entirely preventable and
OL,8,Favoidable" and issued a fine of #7,500.
OL,9,FReacting, the family said they felt it
OL,10,Fwas too low but wanted to move on.
